# Keep shell scripts LF so the NAS /bin/sh never sees a CR (a \r breaks the shebang
# and every command). Scoped to scripts on purpose — NO tree-wide `* text=auto`,
# which would trigger the CRLF re-normalization churn we avoid by never `git add -A`.
*.sh text eol=lf
# Windows batch stays CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
